 * .env                contains default values for the environment variables needed by the app
 * .env.local          uncommitted file with local overrides
using .env variables in EXPO requires putting EXPO_PUBLIC_ in front of the variable name

frontend

EXPO_PUBLIC_BACKEND_URL= http://146.190.28.116


ALLOW_URL=  146.190.28.116

DB_NAME=postgres
DB_USER=postgres
DB_PASSWORD=postgres
DB_HOST=127.0.0.1
DB_PORT=5432
